            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
          },
          "body": "Why not make the config parser trim all parameter names to be resistent against such typos? I cannot imagine a parameter name to include leading or trailing spaces, that would be bad usability. Not talking about values here, they sure might need whitespace.",
