            "displayName": "Marcel Reutegger",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Europe/Zurich"
          },
          "body": "> Why not make the config parser trim all parameter names to be resistent against such typos?\n\nI wanted to keep the fix as small as possible because I also wanted to apply it to the branch.\n\n> And what about throwing an exception on error?\n\nThat's a different discussion, please open a new jira issue.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mreutegg",
            "name": "mreutegg",
